  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Entrepreneurship Summit 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will provide funding for USADF&apos;s annual Youth Entrepreneurship Summit, to be held in Dakar, Senegal in 2019. USADF&apos;s in-country partner, ACA, will provide logistical and technical support for the workshop. The workshop will be an opportunity for youth entrepreneurs to come together to exchange ideas, network, and receive leadership development training from USADF and Echoing Green.</narrative>
  </description>
